      "audio": "audio/s-de63a542ea804d198e4bf293546ece8c.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-ea2fb18a985641a7ae3862801d265e45",
      "text_id": "t02",
      "text": "我认为卢卡斯是个心口如一的人。",
      "audio": "audio/s-ea2fb18a985641a7ae3862801d265e45.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-ea3f4e27236e4c68a830760a520c85b9",
      "text_id": "t04",
      "text": "我告诉过他杰利改头换面了。",
      "audio": "audio/s-ea3f4e27236e4c68a830760a520c85b9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-eb64d34edf0540e79024bddf65f0d0f7",
      "text_id": "t12",
      "text": "但她家有一张我的照片。",
      "audio": "audio/s-eb64d34edf0540e79024bddf65f0d0f7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-ee9528d83d4c471babcb8aa68848f37f",
      "text_id": "t12",
      "text": "但她家有一张我的照片。",
      "audio": "audio/s-ee9528d83d4c471babcb8aa68848f37f.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.51
    },
    {
      "id": "s-f125178ddfc447ee8a4085dd9c7eb1c9",
      "text_id": "t03",
      "text": "那你还站在这里和我谈什么？",
      "audio": "audio/s-f125178ddfc447ee8a4085dd9c7eb1c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-f92d2948024e4d46b0ec9b27c581a5ce",
      "text_id": "t07",
      "text": "老大我想你该看看这个。",
      "audio": "audio/s-f92d2948024e4d46b0ec9b27c581a5ce.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-fb74a75d23384067b06da24a03aea467",
      "text_id": "t03",
      "text": "那你还站在这里和我谈什么？",
      "audio": "audio/s-fb74a75d23384067b06da24a03aea467.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.84
    },
    {
      "id": "s-fbee694b8bf24ef084716b96cc05a5f7",
      "text_id": "t05",
      "text": "但并不是做出好产品的必要条件。",
      "audio": "audio/s-fbee694b8bf24ef084716b96cc05a5f7.wav"
    }
  ],
  "practice": [
    {
      "id": "practice-01",
      "text": "你能救全世界吗？",
      "audio": "audio/practice-01.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.06
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-02",
      "text": "我要亲身感受它。",
      "audio": "audio/practice-02.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.09
    }
  ]
}
